    {
      "tag": "p",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Terms and Conditions of the Rewards Program"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "anchor": "general-provisions"
    },
    {
      "tag": "h2",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "1. General Provisions"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "1.1. The Rewards Program (the \"Program\") is offered by the Decentraland Foundation and is conducted in specific Seasons, the dates of which will be announced by the Decentraland Foundation."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "1.2. Participation in the Program constitutes acceptance of these Terms and Conditions, as well as the Decentraland Terms of Use, Privacy Policy, and Content Policy."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "1.3. The Decentraland Foundation reserves the right to modify, suspend, or terminate the Program at its discretion."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "anchor": "program-duration"
    },
    {
      "tag": "h2",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "2. Program Duration and Structure"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "2.1. The Program is organized in Seasons (the \"Season\"). The Decentraland Foundation will announce the start and end dates for each Season."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "anchor": "credits-and-prize-allocation"
    },
    {
      "tag": "h2",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "3. Credits and Prize Allocation"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "3.1. Credits issued under the Program may only be used on primary sales of Polygon Wearables & Emotes (L1 sales are excluded)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "3.2. Each Marketplace Credit is valued in each Season; however this value may be changed (lowered or increased) in the future at the discretion of the Decentraland Foundation."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "3.3. Credits do not represent voting power (VP)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "3.4. A maximum total reward budget is allocated per Season. Once this budget is exhausted, no further rewards will be granted during that Season."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "anchor": "eligibility-and-participation"
    },
    {
      "tag": "h2",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "4. Eligibility and Participation"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "4.1. To be eligible for rewards, participants must complete specified actions, attend designated events, or fulfill other tasks as determined by the Decentraland Foundation."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "4.2. The Decentraland Foundation reserves the right to verify the completion of required actions before awarding any rewards."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "anchor": "earnings-and-credit-allocation"
    },
    {
      "tag": "h2",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "5. Earnings and Credit Allocation"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "5.1. Participants who fully complete all designated weekly goals will earn the maximum Marketplace Credits per week mentioned in the corresponding Season."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "5.2. The maximum Marketplace Credits a user can earn during the Season shall be determined in each Season."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "5.3. A weekly goal must be fully completed to receive its associated credit value."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "5.4. Participants will earn credits only for the goals they fully complete; it is not necessary to complete every goal in order to receive some credit."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "anchor": "reward-validity-and-usage"
    },
    {
      "tag": "h2",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "6. Reward Validity and Usage"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "6.1. Rewards will be valid for a period of weeks to be announced in each Season (the \"validity period\")."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "6.2. Any rewards not redeemed within the validity period will expire and become non-redeemable."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "anchor": "non-transferability"
    },
    {
      "tag": "h2",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "7. Non-Transferability and Restrictions"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "7.1. Rewards are non-transferable and may only be used by the designated recipient."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "7.2. Credits must be issued to a specific beneficiary (a valid EVM Address) and can only be utilized by that beneficiary."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "7.3. Rewards cannot be exchanged for cash, MANA, or any other alternative benefits."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "7.4. Credits cannot be used to publish a collection, used on Ethereum for this iteration, or transferred between users."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "7.5. The Decentraland Foundation reserves the right to revoke or cancel rewards if they are misused or if participants are found to be in violation of the Program's terms."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "anchor": "email-notifications"
    },
    {
      "tag": "h2",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "8. Email Notifications"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "8.1. By participating in the Program, you consent to receive email notifications related to \"Weekly Rewards.\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "8.2. The Decentraland Foundation may add additional email notification categories in the future."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "anchor": "miscellaneous"
    },
    {
      "tag": "h2",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "9. Miscellaneous"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "9.1. The Decentraland Foundation is not responsible for any technical malfunctions, errors, or issues that may affect participation in the Program."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "9.2. Any disputes regarding the Program shall be resolved at the sole discretion of the Decentraland Foundation."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "For further inquiries, please contact "
        },
        {
          "tag": "a",
          "href": "mailto:legal@decentraland.org",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "legal@decentraland.org"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "."
        }
      ]
    },
